OL,3,CWhat is a dust devil and are we seeing
OL,4,Cmore of them in the UK?
OL,6,FThis summer, a number of whirling
OL,7,Fcolumns of sand have been spotted
OL,8,Facross the country, including in Kent
OL,9,Fand Suffolk this week.
OL,11,FBut what are they, and why do they
OL,12,Fhappen? ITV News explains.
OL,14,FWhat is a dust devil?
OL,16,FWhile they can look dramatic, dust
OL,17,Fdevils are a natural weather
OL,18,Fphenomenon that occasionally occurs
OL,19,Facross the UK during warm, settled
OL,20,Fconditions.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
