OL,3,CWhat is a dust devil and are we seeing
OL,4,Cmore of them in the UK?
OL,6,FA dust devil is a small, rotating
OL,7,Fcolumn of air that forms when the sun
OL,8,Fstrongly heats the ground.
OL,10,FAs the air at the surface warms, it
OL,11,Frises rapidly and, under the right
OL,12,Fconditions, begins to rotate. If it
OL,13,Fpasses over loose dust, sand or
OL,14,Fdebris, the spinning air becomes
OL,15,Fvisible.
OL,17,FThey can reach heights of several
OL,18,Fhundred metres and usually last for
OL,19,Fonly a few minutes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
