OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785887271
OL,3,CWhat is a dust devil and are we seeing
OL,4,Cmore of them in the UK?
OL,6,FTornadoes, on the other hand, form
OL,7,Ffrom powerful thunderstorms and are
OL,8,Fcapable of producing destructive winds.
OL,10,FGiven the hot, dry conditions this
OL,11,Fsummer, are dust devils going to
OL,12,Fhappen more frequently in the UK?
OL,14,FWhile they are more commonly
OL,15,Fassociated with hot, arid regions -
OL,16,Fespecially the US, dust devils can and
OL,17,Fdo occur in the UK.
OL,19,FThey are more common during spells of
OL,20,Fwarm, dry and settled weather.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/6
